NAME
    gcloud compute health-sources - manage health sources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud compute health-sources COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage health sources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create a health source.

     delete
        Delete a health source.

     describe
        Describe a health source.

     get-health
        Get health status of a health source.

     list
        List health sources.

     update
        Update a health source.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha compute health-sources

        $ gcloud beta compute health-sources

